        <briefdescription>
<para>Track the reference to metadata. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_register" kindref="compound">Register</ref> <computeroutput>MD</computeroutput> with <computeroutput>*MD</computeroutput>, if the subclass supports tracking. If <computeroutput>*MD</computeroutput> gets RAUW&apos;ed, <computeroutput>MD</computeroutput> will be updated to the new address. If <computeroutput>*MD</computeroutput> gets deleted, <computeroutput>MD</computeroutput> will be set to <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>If tracking isn&apos;t supported, <computeroutput>*MD</computeroutput> will not change.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true iff tracking is supported by <computeroutput>MD</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
