    <briefdescription>
<para>API for tracking metadata references through RAUW and deletion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Shared API for updating <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_metadata" kindref="compound">Metadata</ref></emphasis> pointers in subclasses that support RAUW.</para>
<para>This API is not meant to be used directly. See <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_tracking_m_d_ref" kindref="compound">TrackingMDRef</ref></emphasis> for a user-friendly tracking reference. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
